# Local editor configuration is machine- and developer-specific. Sharing it
# creates noise and conflict. Each developer keeps their own preferences.
#
# Exception: a project-wide `.editorconfig` (if ever added) SHOULD be tracked
# — it enforces consistent formatting across editors and is intentionally not
# covered by the rules below.
# =============================================================================

# --- VS Code ---
.vscode/
